        "value": "Geese turn north;Magpies nest;Pheasants call;Hens brood;Hawks hunt fiercely;Ponds freeze solid;East wind thaws ice;Insects stir;Fish rise to the ice;Otters lay out fish;Geese return;Plants sprout;Peach trees bloom;Orioles sing;Hawks turn to doves;Swallows return;Thunder returns;Lightning appears;Paulownias bloom;Voles turn to quails;Rainbows appear;Duckweed appears;Cuckoos preen;Hoopoes on mulberries;Mole crickets chirp;Earthworms surface;Snake gourds grow;Sow thistle thrives;Fine grasses wither;Wheat ripens;Mantises hatch;Shrikes call;Mockingbirds hush;Deer shed antlers;Cicadas sing;Crow-dipper sprouts;Warm winds arrive;Crickets shelter;Young hawks hunt;Fireflies appear;Soil damp, air muggy;Heavy rains come;Cool winds arrive;White dew falls;Cold cicadas sing;Hawks lay out prey;Nature turns austere;Grain ripens;Geese fly south;Swallows leave;Birds store food;Thunder ceases;Insects seal burrows;Waters dry up;Geese arrive as guests;Sparrows turn to clams;Chrysanthemums bloom;Jackals lay out prey;Leaves turn and fall;Insects go dormant;Water freezes;Ground freezes;Pheasants become clams;Rainbows hide;Sky and earth part;Winter sets in;Night birds go quiet;Tigers court;Irises sprout;Earthworms curl up;Elk shed antlers;Springs start to flow"
